    "source_reviewed_changes": [
      "Named per-repository server profiles and explicit repository identity improve routing; storage adds V68-V70 migrations.",
      "Optional external capture ownership and a durable companion relay support producer retries; the documented idempotency window is 30 days.",
      "Managed run can finalize supported sessions whose harness lacks a native terminal hook.",
      "Consolidation applies a default 0.8 safety margin to an approximate input budget; default bootstrap chunk output requests are capped at 16K."
    ],
